[en.FOCUS_C08_LOYAL_ALLIES]
Loyal Allies

[en.FOCUS_C08_LOYAL_ALLIES_desc]
During the last contact day, we have sent a radio to Discord and Sunset Shimer to ensure smooth communication.

After the M6 were secretly transferred and vanished following “Jahr Null”, communications among the united resistance organizations fell into chaos. Now that the radio is open, use it to restore the communication line when the next contact day arrives.

[zh.FOCUS_C08_LOYAL_ALLIES]
忠实盟友

[zh.FOCUS_C08_LOYAL_ALLIES_desc]
上一个联络日时，我们已经向无序和余晖烁烁各送了一部电台，用以确保联络畅通。

M6在“新元年”后被秘密转移并失去音讯，联合抵抗组织之间也几乎陷入联络混乱。现在电台已经开通，那么在下一个联络日到来的时候，用电台来恢复联络线吧。

